      "text": "60 feet. A creature that enters the emanation or starts its turn within it tumbles down a deep well of dread and must attempt a DC 33 Will save save.\n\nCritical Success The target is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The target becomes Frightened 1.\n\nFailure The target becomes Frightened 2.\n\nCritical Failure The target becomes Frightened 3 and Immobilized until it's no longer frightened.",
