      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Consume Emotion",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "The kilia mwibo feeds on the negative emotions of a creature within 60 feet; this must be a creature that it can precisely sense with its emotion sense. The target must succeed at a DC 36 Will save save or increase its Drained condition value by 1 (by 2 on a critical failure), to a maximum of drained 4."
